// The handlers the stepper (step.id) sends an instruction to, one per class
// of instruction in conf.id's bkk_opcls. Each is given the thread and the pc
// of the instruction, reads its operands from the program's code, and answers
// the pc to run next, -1 to yield or a trap (bkk_r_trap less the error
// number). bkv_after turns the trap list the leaf routines leave their error
// in into that answer.

